# Stack Conventions

## Framework
- **Next.js 16** App Router, **React 19**, **TypeScript 5** (`strict: true`)
- Path alias `@/*` maps to project root
- `"use client"` only when hooks or browser APIs are needed — default to Server Components

## Auth (Supabase)
- Browser client → `lib/supabase/client.ts` (`createBrowserClient`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`)
- Admin/server client → `lib/supabase/admin.ts` (service role, Route Handlers **only**)
- Session gate lives in **`proxy.ts`** (Next.js 16 Proxy) — **never add `middleware.ts`** alongside it or the build fails
- After MFA verify: always call `refreshSession()` then `window.location.assign()` (full nav) so AAL2 cookies are set before proxy.ts runs
- Safe redirects only via `lib/auth/safe-return-path.ts`
- Default post-login destination via `lib/auth/resolve-default-home.ts`

## Styling
- **Tailwind CSS v4** + `@tailwindcss/postcss` — no `tailwind.config.ts`
- All color tokens via CSS variables (see `ui-design-system` rule) — **never hardcode hex**
- shadcn CLI for UI primitives (`components.json` style: `base-nova`)
- Icons: **lucide-react** only

## Environment variables
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` — browser-safe
- `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` — server only, never import in client components
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` — canonical origin for redirect URLs
